Z||000030||rogergarrison||06-15-2001||05:00 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mblackwell:<BR><B>Progress report:<P>Last night I sprayed my hood.  I went out to look at how it dried this morning and it had F****ING BUGS dried onto it.  It also has some streaks and dust in it.  Even with all that it still looks better than before.  Today I'm gonna sand the junk out and put on another coat.  This time I'll close the garrage door after I spray it.<P>some advice to cut down on dust and bugs, spray it early in the morning before the dust is all stirred up in the air, before the bugs all come out.<P>Here is a before pic:<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallfront.jpg">  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||1
